OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Miles Davis
OL,5,     F100
OL,6,     GKate Molleson explores the life
OL,7,     Gand work of a cultural icon:
OL,8,     Gtrumpeter, composer and
OL,9,     Gbandleader Miles Davis.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GLumas Winds perform live in the
OL,12,     Gstudio and opera writer and
OL,13,     Gbroadcaster Sarah Lenton talks
OL,14,     GKatie Derham through this
OL,15,     Gsummer's opera highlights.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GTake time our with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,19,     Gfavourites by composers such as
OL,20,     GBorodin, Rachmaninov and Rameau.
