OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 25 MAY
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GAs part of Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,6,     GAnniversary Festival, Ian Skelly
OL,7,     Gcomperes a special programme
OL,8,     Greplicating elements from
OL,9,     GWigmore's inaugural concert on
OL,10,     G31st May 1901.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Miles Davis 100 -
OL,12,     FMiles Beyond
OL,13,     GJournalist Kevin Le Gendre
OL,14,     Ginvestigates how Miles Davis
OL,15,     Gnavigated racial politics and
OL,16,     Gperceptions of blackness, in his
OL,17,     Glife and music.
